{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/61233a096446b574d1028dbaaf15c4e4.avif?t=1754710224\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem is an online party game, featuring physics based combat with cars. You and up to 7 friends battle it out for victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/9f3d059841e62f6876d2d4c7a7c30925.avif?t=1754710224\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras_big/9f3d059841e62f6876d2d4c7a7c30925.avif?t=1754710224 width=800 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.poster.avif?t=1754710224\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.webm?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.mp4?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to win is to outlast your opponents. Make sure you get to the circle on time to stay alive! \u2026 And be careful not to fall off the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/1fe65a12da5e72be42b79ef0de69f0ea.avif?t=1754710224\" width=1600 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.poster.avif?t=1754710224\" width=652 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.webm?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/24da983307b6f050445aaa103bd6c938.mp4?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem features nearly a dozen unique cars, and each of them has a unique play style and ability. Want bigger critical hits to focus on killing your opponents? You got it. Want extra speed for survivability? That\u2019s an option too.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/af2111ef6f3108c355ab5e921cdb783b.avif?t=1754710224\" width=1600 height=186 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.poster.avif?t=1754710224\" width=652 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.webm?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/d2a57e35b5bcfd6ab44788d3877f9b4d.mp4?t=1754710224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics based combat naturally allows for funny moments to occur. Especially if you give the golf cart a good whack\u2026 Just be sure you aren\u2019t hitting your teammates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, are you ready for some <span class=\"bb_strike\">mayhem</span>\u00a0<i><strong>Carhem</strong></i>?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1754710224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3349910?t=1754710224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/89c569352cccb9a9849516b594fc66bc66cbeec2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754710224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/89c569352cccb9a9849516b594fc66bc66cbeec2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754710224","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/61233a096446b574d1028dbaaf15c4e4.avif?t=1754710224\" width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carhem is an online party game, featuring physics based combat with cars. You and up to 7 friends battle it out for victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/9f3d059841e62f6876d2d4c7a7c30925.avif?t=1754710224\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras_big/9f3d059841e62f6876d2d4c7a7c30925.avif?t=1754710224 width=800 height=93 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3349910/extras/5372e6fa30374a14c7f2e1a7cb9e598d.poster.avif?t=1754710